abstract: >-
  Analysis scripts for gene-level and splice-event-level profiling of a chronic ovalbumin model of
  allergic airway inflammation, splicing-factor and transcription-factor layer analysis,
  novel-transcript annotation sensitivity, cross-species mapping to two human asthma cohorts, and
  receiver-operating-characteristic comparison with DeLong testing and type-2 stratification.
